	(text "LAYOUT: Place the 100 nF input bypass capacitor directly at IN-GND. \nKeep the ILIM resistor and its ground connection close to the IC. \nPlace the VBUS_HOST bulk capacitor close to the switch output and USB-A connector. \nUse short, wide traces for the VBUS power path."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 254.254 95.504 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 0.508 0.508)
				(color 124 0 0 1)
			)
		)
		(uuid "01107737-83f9-4280-b455-c9f7dcafdbd4")
	)
	(text "LAYOUT: Keep the PMID-SW-L-SYS high-current loop compact. \nPlace the VBUS, PMID, BAT, SYS and REGN capacitors at their associated pins. \nMinimize SW copper. Solder the exposed PowerPAD and connect it with thermal vias. \nJoin CHG_PGND to GND only at the local charger ground connection."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 65.024 93.472 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 0.762 0.762)
				(color 124 0 0 1)
			)
		)
		(uuid "0ac8d122-5bae-44c3-a391-3c5b0a242524")
	)
	(text "SWITCHABLE 5 V BOOST REGULATOR - TPS61022\nVSYS TO +5V_SYS"
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 189.738 102.362 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
			)
		)
		(uuid "2b19ec2b-79c1-47cd-9cee-5b6b6e20ef76")
	)
	(text "1S LI-ION FUEL GAUGE - MAX17048"
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 260.858 16.002 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
			)
		)
		(uuid "32c5b153-a412-450c-b107-6ba22ad70649")
	)
	(text "LAYOUT: Place the 100 nF VDD bypass capacitor directly at VDD-GND. \nRoute VDD and CELL directly to protected VBAT and away from switching nodes. \nFor MAX17048, VDD is the supply and 1-cell voltage-sense input. \nCELL is not internally connected but must still be connected to protected VBAT as shown in the application circuit. \nConnect CTG and exposed pad to GND."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 246.126 48.006 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 0.762 0.762)
				(color 124 0 0 1)
			)
		)
		(uuid "33a43ce0-9881-47c6-a67b-6f6aca08f176")
	)
	(text "USB-C INPUT / 1S LI-ION CHARGER AND POWER PATH - BQ25895"
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 109.22 14.732 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
			)
		)
		(uuid "45df4103-744e-4ca4-8581-bba53a8ca721")
	)
	(text "MAIN 3.3 V BUCK-BOOST REGULATOR - LT3154\nVSYS TO +3V3"
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 137.922 103.378 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
			)
		)
		(uuid "57beae4f-f352-4ec7-8fb0-a681b68e7b02")
	)
	(text "LAYOUT: Place PVIN and PVOUT capacitors directly beside the IC and PGND. \nKeep the inductor and SW1/SW2 paths short and wide while minimizing switch-node copper. \nRoute FB, VC and RT away from SW1/SW2. Connect the exposed pad to the GND plane with multiple vias.\n2.2 capacitor must be close to VIN"
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 66.802 189.992 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 0.762 0.762)
				(color 124 0 0 1)
			)
		)
		(uuid "9606bdd2-cbf0-46ac-afb3-65424de48a99")
	)
	(text "USB-A VBUS LOAD SWITCH AND CURRENT LIMIT - TPS2553\n+5V_SYS TO VBUS_HOST"
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 212.598 60.452 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
			)
		)
		(uuid "b0683182-2d43-4265-89f1-0e11d1f841d5")
	)
	(text "LAYOUT: Place the input capacitor at VIN-GND, \nthe inductor at SW and the output capacitors at VOUT-GND. \nMinimize the SW-node area. \nRoute FB from the output-capacitor node and keep the feedback divider away from SW."
